addcdiv(input, tensor1, tensor2, *, value=1, out=None) -> Tensor

Performs the element-wise division of :attr:`tensor1` by :attr:`tensor2`,
multiplies the result by the scalar :attr:`value` and adds it to :attr:`input`.

